UnitVotingEscrow::IsAuthorizedVPMForToken
├── when the vpm holds the vpm role and the owner approved it
│   └── it should return true
├── when the vpm holds the vpm role but the owner has not approved it
│   └── it should return false
├── when the vpm does not hold the vpm role
│   └── it should return false
└── when the token id has not been minted
    └── it should return false without reverting
